WHAT THIS COVERS

This licence covers the parts of this repository that originate here: the generated
internal quantities and external profits, the per-dataset parameter choices, the
SHA-256 manifests, and the selection and arrangement of the released collection.

WHAT IT DOES NOT COVER

The underlying sequence structure comes from the public SPMF dataset collection
(https://www.philippe-fournier-viger.com/spmf/) and is redistributed here unchanged
in its ordering and item identities. Rights in that material remain with its
original holders; this licence grants nothing over it.

ATTRIBUTION

Reusers must credit both this repository and the SPMF collection it derives from.

FULL TEXT

